  Hello!
   
  A reservation has been made on your behalf at the beautiful Creekside Inn from January 15 until January 21 to accommodate you during the workshop. The hotel is within walking distance from AIM and offers complimentary high-speed internet access. The contact information for the Creekside Inn is as follows:
   
  Address: 
  3400 El Camino Real
  Palo Alto, CA 94306
   
  Phone: 
  (650) 493-2411

The Creekside Inn is within walking distance from AIM and offers quiet, non-smoking rooms with complementary high-speed Internet access.

Upon check-in at the hotel be sure you pick up a packet from the front desk. Within this packet you will find a map directing you to AIM, list local restaurants, a map of the institute facilities, a guide to computing at AIM as well as a reimbursement form.

For funded participants, we will be able to take care of all reimbursements while you are here at the workshop. We ask you to please keep track of all receipts related to your attendance, not including those for meals as a per diem will be provided.
   
  When you arrive at the airport, we recommend that you take a shuttle rather than a taxi. If traveling from San Francisco International, SuperShuttle is a reputable shuttle service that is readily available at the airport. If traveling from San Jose International, we recommend that you take South & East Bay Airport Shuttle. The fare coming from either airport should cost you $26.00-$35.00.
   
  Unless previously agreed upon, AIM does not reimburse rental cars since the Institute is so close to the hotel. A total of $52.00 will be reimbursed for rentals.
   
  Directions for catching a SuperShuttle are as follows:
   
  Claim your luggage on the lower level. Proceed to the upper level and outside to the outer curb. Follow the blue SuperShuttle signs to the uniformed Airport Guest Coordinators in blue jackets. They will arrange SuperShuttle transportation to your destination.
  Whichever shuttle you decide to go with, you should give the driver the following information to get to the hotel:
   
  From: San Francisco International           To: Creekside Inn
  3400 El Camino Real
  Palo Alto, CA 94306
  Distance: 22.52 miles
  Total Estimated Time: 25 minutes
   
  1. Start out going East on DOMESTIC TERMINAL toward AIRPORT EXIT. 0.09 Miles
  2. Turn LEFT onto AIRPORT EXIT. 0.19 Miles
  3. Merge onto US-101 S toward SAN JOSE. 19.38 Miles
  4. Take the EMBARCADERO RD/OREGON EXPWY exit. 0.16 Miles
  5. Take the EMBARCADERO RD EAST/OREGON EXPWY ramp. 0.17 Miles
  6. Take the OREGON EXPWY ramp toward SAN JOSE. 0.07 Miles
  7. Take the OREGON EXPWY ramp. 0.11 Miles
  8. Merge onto CR-G3. 1.92 Miles
  9. Turn LEFT onto EL CAMINO REAL/CA-82. 0.42 Miles
   
  From: San Jose Airport               To: Creekside Inn
  3400 El Camino Real
  Palo Alto, CA 94306
   
  1. Start out going Northwest on AIRPORT BLVD toward TERMINAL C. 0.19 Miles 2. Turn RIGHT onto AIRPORT PKWY. 0.13 Miles 
  3. Turn LEFT onto GUADALUPE PKWY/CA-87 N. 0.40 Miles 
  4. Merge onto US-101 N toward SAN FRANCISCO. 11.83 Miles 
  5. Take the EMBARCADERO RD/OREGON EXPWY exit. 0.14 Miles 
  6. Take the OREGON EXPWY ramp. 0.19 Miles 
  7. Merge onto CR-G3. 2.10 Miles 
  8. Turn LEFT onto EL CAMINO REAL/CA-82. 0.42 Miles
   
  If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact me. If not, I hope you have a very safe trip.
   
  Sincerely,
  Meghan Criswell
  Executive Assistant
  American Institute of Mathematics 



